# Unity project rules, adapted from:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Unity.gitignore
# Keep Assets (including .meta), Packages and ProjectSettings in version control.

# Unity caches and local editor state
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/.utmp/
*.log

# Build output and diagnostic captures
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/
/*_BackUpThisFolder_ButDontShipItWithYourGame/
/*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/
/ExportedObj/
*.apk
*.aab
*.obb
*.app

# Local IDE settings and caches
/.vs/
/.vscode/
/.idea/
/.gradle/
*.DotSettings.user

# Generated solution and project files
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# Temporary files and crash reports
*.tmp
/sysinfo.txt
mono_crash.*
.dirstamp
tmpinst-dir.stamp

# Unity crash recovery scenes and their metadata
/[Aa]ssets/_Recovery/
/[Aa]ssets/_Recovery.meta

# Generated Rider integration and UI schemas
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
/UIElementsSchema/

# Operating system metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
